# Vercel builds dist/ with scripts/build-site.mjs and serves only that
# folder, so nothing outside the script's PUBLIC list is ever published.
# The entries below just keep files the build does not need out of the
# upload. scripts/ and portal/ must NOT be listed: the build runs from them.
# The API deploys separately on Railway from server/.
server
trading-bot
docs
Client Kickoff
*.md
